Go2-X5-lab Script Layout
========================

Use this directory as a task-oriented command index.

- control/: manual Go2-X5 keyboard control entrypoints.
- visualization/: camera, ground-pick, and VLA-SFT scene preview utilities.
- reinforcement_learning/: RSL-RL and CusRL training/play entrypoints.
- assets/: URDF/MJCF conversion and local VLA render asset download utilities.
- checkpoints/: checkpoint migration and model-shape adjustment helpers.
- maintenance/: cleanup and environment listing utilities.

Test-only programs live under ../test.
